WEBVTT

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:19.580
The dorm mother's box lunches
always look so good!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.040
You think so? Looks average to me.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.960
It's pretty brown.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:30.430
I wish it had some cuter stuff in it.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.510
Food always tastes great
when it's made just for you!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.180
Right?

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:34.890
Mm-hmm!

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:38.270
I see Narata-<i>san </i>isn't here.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.810
Huh? Ai-<i>chan</i>?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:23.580
The Teddy Bear

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.830
What're you doing out here?

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:28.460
You know, if you eat alone out here,
the second-years will get on your case.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.920
I don't want to eat lunch
in that tiny locker room.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.720
And making small talk
with everyone's such a pain.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.930
How are things going with
your roommate, Watanabe-<i>san</i>?

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:39.930
She seems fun.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:42.980
What?! She's not "fun" at all!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:46.270
She's so loud, she doesn't listen,

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.900
and she can't read the room
to save her life!

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.070
She's always rolling off the bed,
she never gets up on time...

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.940
God, I wish I could change rooms.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.280
Wow.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:03:01.160
You've changed a little, Ai. You usually
never take interest in other people.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.370
I'm not interested in her!

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:07.620
She just keeps forcing
herself into my life!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:08.670
She's so annoying.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:13.960
I don't know. It seems like
you can't take your eyes off her.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.010
You don't get it, Taichi.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.970
You don't get how
unbearably annoying she is!

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.440
I don't think she's a bad person.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.520
I hope you can be friends.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.650
I don't need friends.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.900
If I want to talk, I'll talk to you.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.280
There's no way I could ever be
friends with Watanabe-<i>san</i>.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.780
Ai-<i>chan</i>! Where'd you disappear to?

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.780
Nowhere.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.870
I thought you might be in the bathroom,
but you were gone so long!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.790
Are you feeling okay?

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.370
Did you eat lunch?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.330
Yep.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:53.460
Y'know, I'm always worried
about you not eating enough!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.340
You don't need to worry about me.

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:59.050
Don't say that! We're friends, aren't we?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.560
We're not.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:21.820
Hana no Michi: 
Flower Way

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.740
If I wait here, maybe I'll see Naracchi.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.290
But we're roommates!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:30.250
I want to be friends with you!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.790
I don't really want to be
friends with anyone.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:34.920
Huh?

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:40.050
Dealing with people is annoying
and a waste of my time.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.220
No!

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:44.390
Hey, you girls! No shouting in the halls!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:46.270
Sorry.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.640
Let's go.

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:52.400
I don't need friends.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.820
I just want to be as far away
as possible from the world of men.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.400
That's all I want.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.410
The words "you're so pretty!"
and "what a cutie!"

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:07.490
have always meant "hello" to me.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.870
Narata Family 
Memorial Event

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.460
My goodness, Ai-<i>chan</i>,
you just keep getting cuter!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:16.550
I can hardly tell
if you're real or just a doll!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.550
What a big teddy bear!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.090
My daddy bought it for me!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.430
Wow, really?

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.640
That's not true.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:28.020
That's just what my mom said,
so it's probably not true.

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:31.350
So, who <i>is </i>your daddy, Ai-<i>chan</i>?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.230
I dunno.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.520
That's the truth.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:38.070
My mom is the famous
movie actress Kimiko Narata.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.530
Ai's such a cutie.
No wonder she's popular.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:43.160
My uncle Taichi is a ballet dancer.

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.780
That's not why.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.370
They just want to know who her father is.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.790
So do I, sister.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.840
The old man in Hachioji
told me a funny story...

00:05:56.840 --> 00:06:02.170
...about my siblings chasing down
every last man in the city.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.300
Hey, Narata!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.270
I saw your mom's titties on TV last night!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:14.390
Narata's mom's titties are so jiggly!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.850
Stop it!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.110
Boys are so dumb!

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.440
Be nice to Ai-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.690
It's okay, I don't care.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:30.450
My mom's working really hard.
I've never been ashamed of her.

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.410
That's also a lie.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.870
I've never seen any of my mom's movies.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:39.090
But my mom always tells me

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:41.800
that I'm the reason she works so hard.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.510
And that cute girls
have to 'tough it out.'

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:49.720
It happened around the time I'd
gotten way bigger than Papa Bear.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.560
This is Seiji-<i>san</i>.

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:57.980
He might be your new daddy someday!

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:03.110
Hey there, Ai-<i>chan</i>.
It's real nice to meet you.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.990
It's nice to meet you, too.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:16.120
Seiji-<i>san </i>is such a nice guy, and he's
gonna live with us from here on out!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.370
Huh?

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.130
My mom never told me where she met him,

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:25.880
or what he did for a living.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:30.430
But that wasn't new.
She never told me anything.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.860
Almost got it...

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:42.610
Yes!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.900
I can see your undies.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.660
You're such a cutie, Ai-<i>chan</i>.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:08:00.750
His smile made my stomach turn,
but it must've just been my imagination.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:05.880
I mean, my mom picked him out.
He couldn't be bad.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.680
He never even got mad at me.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:12.260
So when he was waiting outside
the door when I got out of the bath,

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:16.020
or always stopped in front of my door
when he walked down the hall,

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:17.730
I figured it must be a coincidence.

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.610
My mom's smart.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.730
All grown-ups are.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:29.200
They all know so much more than I do.
They'd never be wrong.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.570
Ai!

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:42.790
I'm off to my one-week location shoot!
Be good for Seiji-<i>san</i>, okay?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.750
I hope it goes well.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.170
And, uh, come home soon, okay?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:54.390
What? C'mon, you're too old
for this baby nonsense.

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:57.020
Listen to Seiji-<i>san </i>now.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:59.020
Okay, but...

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:04.230
You know I'm working myself
to death for you, right?

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:09.860
Yeah, that's it!

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.860
You're so good at this, Miki-<i>chan</i>!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:16.410
Ai-<i>chan</i>, it's getting dark!
You should head home.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.490
Okay.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.080
Here, I made some cupcakes.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.920
Take some home with you.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:26.750
Wow! You made these?
You didn't buy them at a store?!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:30.340
Bye-bye!

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:36.720
Ai-<i>chan </i>doesn't go on
playdates very often.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:40.890
Really? She's such a cutie, though.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.350
Right?!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:56.200
I don't wanna go home.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.380
Huh?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.720
Welcome back.

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.140
You're home late.
I was so worried about you.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:29.530
I wasn't sure what you liked to eat,
so I ordered a whole bunch of things.

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.650
C'mon, let's have dinner.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:34.990
No thanks.

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:37.700
I got a cupcake from my friend's house.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:45.080
Really? That's too bad.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:50.420
Y'know, I really want to be
friends with you, Ai-<i>chan</i>.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.090
B-But we are friends!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:57.640
Really? Then to prove it,
will you give me a kiss?

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:58.680
Huh?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.730
My cute little Ai-<i>chan</i>.
You're such a <i>good girl</i>.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.730
Wait, I don't--

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:09.900
Huh?

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.030
What is he doing?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.240
Gross!

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:30.000
I'm dirty. I'm dirty.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.750
He made me dirty!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:37.340
His tongue moved around in my mouth
like a wet, warm slug.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.430
You know what happens to dirty sluts?

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.890
They get pregnant!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:48.190
He made me a dirty slut.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:52.070
Oh, no. What if I get pregnant?

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:57.320
Maybe if I tie my tummy real tight,
it won't get big.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.870
Mommy!

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:05.450
What's wrong?
I'm in the middle of a shoot.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.920
Please come home!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:11.630
God, you've been such a baby lately!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.340
I'm scared of him!

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:16.090
Of who? Seiji-<i>san</i>?

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:19.130
He's always staring at me!

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:25.640
And he waits for me
in front of my room! And he--

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.600
Look, Ai, you're just making
a fuss over nothing.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:32.820
This happens to girls all the time.

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:35.150
I have to go.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.940
But today he--

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:42.030
Come on, Ai. What am I going to do
with a little girl like you?

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.830
I knew it all along.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.670
My mom wasn't working hard for me.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:57.880
She loved work more than she loved me.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:01.720
My daddy didn't buy me this bear.

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:06.930
Because my mom's an actress,
and my dad's not around,

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.980
if I'm not perfect, everyone will
start gossiping about her.

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:15.400
That's why I pretended to be
a happy little girl.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:20.360
I lied to everyone and stuffed
all those feelings down inside.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.740
I won't be lonely! I'll be okay!

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:29.370
My daddy got it for me!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.830
Mommy! Hey, Mommy!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.210
I love you!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.670
Now nobody can stuff
anything else inside me.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.060
Ai, are you awake?

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:57.730
I'm coming in, okay?

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:10.700
What happened to your hair? Are you okay?

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.550
Do you want me to do anything?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:30.140
Put a lock on my door, please.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:37.190
A few days later, when my mom came back,
she had a huge fight with Taichi.

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:41.070
Here's the key to your room, Ai.

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:42.610
Thank you.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.360
I have one more thing for you.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.320
It's a lucky charm.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.330
A key to my house.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:54.750
If anything bad happens,
you can run away to my place.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:04.430
Years passed, and soon,
I was in junior high.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:07.680
That man was still
leeching off of my family.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:11.310
The lock on my door
kept any danger at bay,

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:14.520
and I learned that you can't
get pregnant from kissing.

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:18.270
Even still, I never felt safe.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:22.940
The other kids started to call me
an emotionless "noh mask"

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:27.490
and it wasn't long before
I lost all my friends.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:33.500
Pigs. I wish all men would die.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:38.880
These thoughts rang out through my head as
I imagined mowing down men with gunfire.

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:42.800
Taichi can live, I guess.

