00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:52.470
Yes, it's an idol group I'm producing.

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:56.770
It's a group of girls ages 14 and up.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.230
An all-girl group.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:04.190
When I saw your daughter, Narata-<i>san</i>,
I knew she'd be a perfect fit!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.240
I couldn't disagree more.
She's just not the type.

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:11.450
You see, that's what makes her perfect!
We need cool-headed girls like her, too.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.240
Our studio's just down in Akihabara.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.330
Akiba. That's where Taichi lives!

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.330
I'll do it.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.630
What?!

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.590
I was so stupid.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:26.420
I didn't even stop to think about the
target audience of an all-girl idol group.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.220
Years later...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.720
Let go, creep.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:39.810
...it would lead to
my cold words that day.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.190
Ugh, I can't believe her!

00:16:42.190 --> 00:16:47.070
That Sarasa Watanabe! She must've
said something to you again!

00:16:47.070 --> 00:16:49.450
Why else would you be this mad at her?

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:53.950
It was my fault, anyway.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.870
You're so sweet, Narata-<i>san</i>.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.880
If anything bad happens to you,
feel free to tell me.

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:06.420
I'll handle it for you.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.720
In tap dancing, you produce a rhythm
with the toe, ball, and heel of your foot.

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:14.100
You become a musical
instrument as you dance.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:17.770
Feel the rhythm in your body.

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:22.350
Ball, heel, ball, heel, heel, heel.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.980
Tap-tap, tap-tap, tap, tap.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.030
Try it!

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:36.660
You catch on quick, Narata. I shouldn't be
surprised, given your stage experience.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:42.460
Watanabe! You're too loud!

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:43.670
Huh?!

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:47.800
Your steps are too heavy! Imagine they're
being sucked down to the floor.

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:49.380
Light movements.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:52.630
Narata-<i>sensei </i>told me the same thing!

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.260
He says I've got good control,
but I'm heavy!

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:58.020
Hey, you! Yamada!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.640
You've gotten fatter.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:08.030
U-Um, I <i>have </i>gained a little weight
since starting school...

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:11.110
A little? Try a lot!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.950
Hold on, Sensei!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:17.830
Girls are cuter if they've got
a couple of curves! Right?

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:21.000
What? That's just what <i>men </i>want!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:27.920
Listen, your biggest audience is women.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.880
And women have a shrewd eye.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.550
Kouka fans want a dreamlike fantasy!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.760
A beauty they could never hope to obtain!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.810
So <i>no fatties</i>. If you want to stay here,
you're going to have to shed those pounds!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.270
You need to take better care of yourself.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:51.900
Like, have some
self-discipline, Yamada-<i>san</i>.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:54.910
Stop it! She's already crying!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:57.740
Be nice to her!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:01.120
I'll never eat food again, I promise!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:04.290
No! That's not good for your health!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:08.500
Let's ask our dorm mom for advice
when we get back, okay?

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.420
Why is she like that?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:16.550
Why does she keep shoving herself
into other people's business?

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:19.050
It makes her even more annoying.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.680
Excuse me.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.530
Do you remember me?

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.360
Kouka School of
Musical and Theatrical Arts

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:34.740
Musical and Theatrical Arts"
Watanabe-<i>san</i>,

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.110
have you seen Ai?

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.490
I think she went back to the dorm.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.280
All right.

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:44.540
Y'know, Watanabe-<i>san</i>, I really hope
you can be friends with Ai.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:49.750
Sure, but she told me we weren't friends.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:56.340
How am I supposed to be friends with her
after she said that to me?

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.390
What's wrong, Ai?

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:05.930
He's here. On the road.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.020
Who's here?

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:10.770
The guy I called a creep
at that fan event.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.280
Oh, God! He followed me here!

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.240
What do I do?!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.530
Hey!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:21.660
I'll walk you back if you want.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:22.620
Huh?

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.700
I mean, we're going back to the same room.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.210
I might not be your friend,
but I can at least walk with you.

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:31.250
Sure, could you?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:31.910
Huh?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.090
Sure!

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:35.090
Let's go, Ai-<i>chan</i>!

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:41.630
NOTICE: Due to increased traffic,
loitering and/or asking Kouka students 
for autographs in this area is prohibited.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.100
I hear that singing a fun song can help

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:45.140
when you're feeling scared!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.100
I'll sing something for you, then!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:56.360
♬ Falling from the sky
like white snow... ♬

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.330
Let go, creep.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:16.260
Hey, you! What do you think you're doing,
stalking a helpless girl like this?!

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.800
I, uh...

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.770
I just, uh, I...

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:30.690
...just wanted to talk
with Naracchi... er, Narata-<i>san</i>.

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:36.230
First, here. You dropped
this earlier, Naracchi.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:38.490
Here!

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:49.660
Go away.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:54.540
Go away!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.920
Do you hate me 'cause I was mean to you?!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.550
Are you here to get back at me?!

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:01.590
I just... I--!

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:06.140
Ai-<i>chan</i>!

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:54.620
Act 4: 
